这只老鼠一直向前走，眼睛不往两边看，真奇怪。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/79/799be2d6291c3b89b6e042018750ca7e17d737496d36828fba44f8dfa057e023.mp3"},{"voiceId":"7812e621-9546-4cab-b788-66a526b6d1cf","displayName":"何叔 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"今天啊我要给大家介绍一个神奇的养生茶呢，很多人都说买不到真货，但是呢只有在我这里才能买到最正宗的这个茶，喝了就知道效果有多好。不信您先试试看，保证让您满意。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/85/854339697be36c8df6c99e06401474e4d879b8b2ad1f3509e95763120addd5c4.mp3"},{"voiceId":"b87de4a7-ca72-4e7e-9bbf-ac5b04424b53","displayName":"历史名著解说 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"赤壁之战后，鲁肃奉孙权之命，千方百计要向蜀汉讨回荆州。为此，鲁肃与临江亭邀请镇守荆州的关羽赴宴，预设伏兵，想以威逼要挟的手段要回荆州。关羽明知有诈，仍只待周仓一人持青龙眼，跃刀勇闯虎穴。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/63/633c8f6d8bc604fd3bfbe89f1e885446a7f4772c967575ff73bb4386964d29e9.mp3"},{"voiceId":"0804710c-8e5e-4b67-acda-5785ef13c309","displayName":"历史解说男声 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"你是个普通的商人，却不慎卷入一场官司。衙门里，你跪在冰冷的地砖上，看着那些趾高气扬的差役，他们随意翻看你的供词，嘴角带着轻蔑的笑，你知道没有银子打点，这官司就算是清清白白，也难脱身。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/7e/7eace4395a1cb8b72bb8bdb121821f60830dd1db5c261c892f44cd6e0a3c3285.mp3"},{"voiceId":"7fb8cd7e-5294-4616-8ac2-f9a6c148b66d","displayName":"台湾女大 · 明亮","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["明亮"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"今天跟姐妹去逛了一下西门张，发现一家超可爱的甜品店，他们家的珍珠奶茶真的很特别。珍珠是现煮的奶茶，也是用台湾本地的茶叶泡制的。姐妹们有空一定要来试试看哦。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/44/44ac94ce9d12e9aa47c992da5e9dcb83fb4a022f8e23e6295348ef66b1a134c9.mp3"},{"voiceId":"164ccfb5-f66b-450f-b890-dc5a375865a4","displayName":"天翼温柔男声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"这部电影展现了人性的善恶两面，主角们在面对诱惑和考验时做出了不同的选择。这些选择将影响他们的一生。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/57/57565da866eb5d492becb44936a359c2efc17255f231c292d4b89aef37b22d71.mp3"},{"voiceId":"518e2cfa-758f-412f-936f-7eafbcb1bfba","displayName":"央视主持康老师 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"各位观众晚上好。今天是中国传统文化走向世界的重要一天。在巴黎举办的中国文化周活动中,我国非物质文化遗产展示获得了广泛好评。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/de/de52d603fb3ab7cb6d6771813354dd5694140276bc2ec23e9095119cbec79cc9.mp3"},{"voiceId":"33d276e9-f09d-4f35-b8c5-4da62fec157f","displayName":"夹子御姐音 · 高冷","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["高冷"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"亲爱的，今天姐姐来教你怎么变得更有魅力哦。记住，自信才是最迷人的妆容，举手投足间的优雅才是真正的吸引力。来跟着姐姐学，让你也成为让人过目不忘的存在。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/5f/5fdbe318ddbdffe4c0f1d3b41823461783b0df492c8c3c47d72e4d687834ab47.mp3"},{"voiceId":"1a94c587-8723-4143-9109-d9f9aa591624","displayName":"宇叔说电影 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"在纳粹集中营里，父亲用谎言为儿子编织了一个美丽的世界。他的乐观和勇敢，让人在泪水中感受到了爱的力量。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a3/a30faefc06688324f0cd39b18e3c27227797efd479ffb1aed700350f4b49c4e4.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ad391aeb-623b-42df-8d93-2c5c053084f9","displayName":"帆登读书 · 磁性","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["磁性"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"读书不是为了记住每一个细节，而是要找到打动自己的那个点。就像我们品尝美食，不是为了分析每种调料，而是享受整体带来的味觉体验。读书也是这样，重要的是与书发生真正的链接。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/e3/e3b223cb43627b70696e90400368c93eb0662b1f4a178a26be4a472b9a521cb5.mp3"},{"voiceId":"6e1296e5-c65a-4bbb-9cc9-c9a63dda815c","displayName":"带货主播英语老师 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"生活就像一本厚重的书，每一页都值得细细品味。年轻的朋友们啊不要害怕迷茫，因为迷茫本身就是成长的印记。在这个喧嚣的世界里，愿你能听见内心最真实的声音，找到属于自己的那份从容。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/8f/8f39a144ec30f521e9323226e46e467a06f16e22a6787ed97b5d4eb91f7f56fc.mp3"},{"voiceId":"d67769e9-eaf1-4396-8e9e-c79a1e8ae2e5","displayName":"年轻甜美女声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"大家好，今天跟大家分享一下职场发展的心得。成功不是偶然的，而是持续学习和努力的结果。要善于发现机会，勇于接受挑战，同时保持谦虚的心态。只有这样，才能在竞争激烈的职场中站稳脚跟。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/81/813f757b90a88a08a1ab0d03c2fb4fdb9156b1ef6d6bf52ddbdbd58917056b73.mp3"},{"voiceId":"1f9b607b-2ec7-5cbd-b86a-6d80e63a1c73","displayName":"影视解说男声 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"在光影交织的银幕世界里，每一个镜头都藏着不为人知的细节。有人看到的是跌宕起伏的剧情，而真正的影迷，总能在细微之处，读懂角色内心的挣扎与温柔。今天，我们就一起走进这部经典作品，揭开它背后被忽略的真相。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/78/782b135122427a7e4e7eadb4d5219a53e156642c811905a936ca20a5b3344678.mp3"},{"voiceId":"c437e588-ed3d-486a-b762-2735dedce96a","displayName":"御感青年男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"时间是个蹩脚的裁缝，把回忆缝的千疮百孔，可还是有风从那些缝隙里灌起来。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/53/534f9d394b3dcb1511b55efce5f0e36679e4d619ea0a061cc3f1c7fa520f472f.mp3"},{"voiceId":"efd779c9-461d-527e-b3b6-3c7f6b340d98","displayName":"情绪播客女 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"~哈喽！周一到周五，每天早晨七点半到九点半的直播片段。 言下之意呢，就是废话有点多，大家也别嫌弃，因为这都是直播间最真实的状态！","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/fb/fb8a0b7ae530773474d2898ebfec0a2f496af198782904decc8866ea619795bd.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ecf051a9-fa47-4ebe-8664-03a65bf762a0","displayName":"慵懒低磁外语男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"后来我们什么都有了，却再也没有了，我们只剩下微信里那个不敢点开的头像。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/3a/3acf2bfd75b7505a3054b589097938a2377d81f814e8bd3aaad619b73224ef22.mp3"},{"voiceId":"e151b011-e43d-43e9-9a59-8a3c307e974a","displayName":"抖音 - 澪恩Seiwen · 慵懒","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["慵懒"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"你最喜欢的那片竹林，我一直替你看着，今年春天又长了心酸。风吹过的时候，声音和你在的时候一样，你什么时候回来，我带你去听。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/31/313a0fc48a55274d65fe2d6207a019359ddf3f5ed14335202af7253f2ec52fb4.mp3"},{"voiceId":"086f5a21-dbfc-44cc-92b2-0ffd65b0a02f","displayName":"晚间电台女声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"亲爱的听众朋友们，晚上好。今晚的音乐时光又和大家见面了。外面下着淅淅沥沥的小雨，不如就让我们一起听着舒缓的音乐，度过这个温馨的夜晚。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/2c/2cdffdf72d1486209b73bd41a8a667303eea3b3baccf1bd5473874d082a9ff63.mp3"},{"voiceId":"f2dc6902-402e-45f2-b83c-e6c4816ef645","displayName":"曾仕强教授 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"你看，现代人总是追求快速成功，其实这是不对的。中国传统文化讲究循序渐进，欲速则不达，做任何事情都要按部就班，就像种树一样。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/00/00e1951bdd310ba8997456c700fb65b24510abefc8acffb1fa3347625682c6cd.mp3"},{"voiceId":"06d04bdb-82fb-40c4-805a-02998314d542","displayName":"柔声细语女声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"让我们一起静静地感受这个清晨的美好，深呼吸，感受阳光，轻轻洒在脸上的温暖，放松身心，卸下所有压力，让平和的心情陪伴着你，开启新的一天。记住，生活中的每一刻都值得珍惜。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/81/8178047978fb2878af57c6e8d04bb5e20823582a85a43b1fa6ff5a24bff185f9.mp3"},{"voiceId":"a1666281-4174-4095-9102-155ca496a877","displayName":"沉稳男老师 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"同学们复习要讲究方法，不能盲目的死记硬背。我建议你们先整理知识框架，再通过例题来加深理解。记住，学习最重要的是理解原理，掌握方法，有不懂的地方，随时问老师，我们一起进步。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/1d/1d0ac9158d723c9e5e33ffea9c94b03b8c00824873fe1892869a0d1ef032d132.mp3"},{"voiceId":"3a17df98-599b-4dbe-ae01-f03d9f8941d7","displayName":"沉郁男声解读电影 · 高冷","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["高冷"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"这部电影以其温情而深刻的故事，触动了我们的心灵。主人公通过生活中的细微之处，如一个微笑，一杯热茶，流露出深深的爱意。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/53/53897cd0ec22c9926de84169b620755182fbe2826ed79a196c3550c274d07421.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ac5573b0-1ed2-427b-b9af-9c2ddb67e86a","displayName":"治愈放松女声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"闭上双眼，让思绪随着呼吸慢慢沉淀，感受此刻的宁静，聆听内心的声音，让温暖的能量流过全身，把疲惫和压力轻轻放下。在这里，你可以完全放松，找到内心的平静。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/4b/4b829801b0e3ca0eedf2bf41272aeb85b41b7646063da08fe4a9fa8592970128.mp3"},{"voiceId":"e4e3550d-4482-4fb8-8800-be913fb15587","displayName":"温柔内敛青年男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"我把喜欢藏进了每一次偶遇里，可你没看过我一眼，这些精心策划，全成了我的独角戏。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a9/a9eb233652bef1990726523aa9396ba5c0fb3f020c1aa32317b7611f4de2e13d.mp3"},{"voiceId":"d8589008-2851-457f-bd7b-0163361d7e6e","displayName":"温柔台湾女声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"今天和朋友去逛一下西门张，发现了一间超可爱的甜点店呢。他们家的草莓蛋糕真的好好吃哦，而且摆台也很精致，最特别的是还可以克制化造型，下次生日可以来定一个呢。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a9/a9026d53e18d591cea4e6988cdfd431e17eb2a4682e1afdefb3c4f4346c09e2d.mp3"},{"voiceId":"beba366f-e9bf-45e9-882f-7ecc5261145e","displayName":"温柔女友声 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"嗯，亲爱的，累了一天，辛苦了让我们一起深呼吸，慢慢放松身心。记住，生活中的每个时刻都值得珍惜，不要给自己太大压力，闭上眼睛，听听内心的声音，感受这份宁静美好。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/31/314d9f8dfbda0ea845ce3b8059d74f9338a5212d11b126ef6ab5418c34167aa9.mp3"},{"voiceId":"2cd879c0-1ba8-460c-a66c-fa895089083c","displayName":"温柔女教师 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"同学们，今天我们来复习一下昨天学习的内容，不要着急，我们慢慢来，每个知识点都很重要。记住，学习不是一蹴而就的事情，需要我们耐心地积累，有不懂的地方，随时举手提问哦。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/7b/7b70caf2107d6998fa3dd225fbd923fb50d567b5eb859d256995e1e4ebde884b.mp3"},{"voiceId":"e701bf1e-53c9-4258-b624-d6f233ab9b95","displayName":"温柔少女音 · 轻快","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["轻快"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"淋过那场大雨，我就不会再期待有人送伞了，因为我自己学会了看天气预报。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/3c/3cb298eabba8a7afe8835ea439b4fca45c7f4a2966616e047237fd5f63773634.mp3"},{"voiceId":"5f6b3094-a018-40c7-9357-2d49c4d6e37e","displayName":"温柔无攻击性青年男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"手机相册里的人笑得那么开心，可我们已经很久没联系了，就像两个平行世界。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/28/28581310db1773d87450d4735f102e6b788ff5da61c348370ec573956239a517.mp3"},{"voiceId":"17703a71-a689-4874-9111-db0227e0a75d","displayName":"温柔甜糯少女音 · 轻快","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["轻快"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"我学会了不哭不闹，把委屈拌进饭里咽下去，然后笑着告诉你，今天的菜有点咸。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/f9/f9199d41274f6429be7699cca3f414b1a6e1d8cd63418e2de2d080fae1af1b45.mp3"},{"voiceId":"945fa47c-59d1-4e54-a105-f5c47329c86d","displayName":"猫耳FM - 初尧 · 古风","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"我不会要求你变成我想要的样子，你就做你自己，开心就笑，难过就哭，想我了，就直接说，我会一直在你一回头就能看见的距离。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/2f/2f51aa8c0f7682f3145f78a2843db558d5447488c63e6ce183c7d3a73722326a.mp3"},{"voiceId":"8321790c-9491-43b7-a57c-dc8b08a4812d","displayName":"猫耳FM - 初尧 · 古风 #2","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"我打败了上一任武林盟主，是个男人。他说的时候说你很强，我说我知道不是傲慢，是我花了几十年，从被人看不起到让人闭嘴，我配得上这两个字。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/3d/3d4aa8bc779dbb7702da4fc471a140fd59b8cefe03b7e289dacd0ecc8ed0b905.mp3"},{"voiceId":"4b1ae0cc-b0fe-4b0f-be35-06cff2997cb0","displayName":"猫耳FM - 本能 · 古风","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"渡口的船夫问我等谁，我说等一个不会来的人，他说那为什么还等？我说等习惯了，船走了又来来了又走，我还在你没来。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a1/a1aa17eb2bad07c7510c22cc2bf3bcdc3717da77aada047060d68a4de32326f5.mp3"},{"voiceId":"f658849a-379e-4f6d-a44a-eef54bea0dd0","displayName":"猫耳FM - 本能） · 古风","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"会遇到更好的人，我知道，但我花了那么多年把你变成最好，你让我怎么重新认识一个人，从头到尾讲一遍我们的故事。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/f6/f62cad0a6963b588f8cb064250e8097c9a0be4de905ec1ea7b03bf22e660b8dc.mp3"},{"voiceId":"aa1d5dbe-e451-4323-8b65-f041e4663758","displayName":"猫耳FM - 温宁 · 古风 #2","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"你说你会记得我语气淡淡的，想说今天天气不错，但我记住了，记很久久到后来，我路过所有像你的背影都会停下来，等那个人回头。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/fb/fb758f6dd6565a4d10774a68aad0f12cf0b16d82519cac16c1a9b6544a2cfd87.mp3"},{"voiceId":"84102c3e-fc12-4921-b9c1-ce9181e032b2","displayName":"猫耳FM - 温宁 · 古风 #3","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"你说你喜欢江南的雨，我便在这檐下等了许多年。雨来了又走，走了又来，唯独你再没有撑伞，走过这条青石板路也罢，本就是风月误我，我又何必怪你。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d5/d59bf2a909e5c364a7ea280576b3e3e1789232586b7717ef2d864050bdfa961e.mp3"},{"voiceId":"22d912de-3283-42c2-8ff0-d3c6675e96f2","displayName":"猫耳FM - 碧清子 · 古风","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"天子之怒，伏尸百万，流血千里，布衣之怒，流血五步，天下缟素，今日是也。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/7e/7e88c186f953d1327e756d1def3ee4132cd55c45f64a29d2bbf1336fa24eaf47.mp3"},{"voiceId":"8fb4038e-6fbe-4103-abe4-693750df8186","displayName":"猫耳FM - 碧清子 · 古风 #2","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"这宫里的墙啊特别厚，隔音也好，就算你叫破了喉咙，也没人听得见。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/c9/c90315c1c4d3be1b74983ac97e5f0d93eab0680c4b6ed9149ca801ba3c950df4.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ff6bdbfd-1f04-48a9-b2b8-cca51b8302c3","displayName":"猫耳FM - 碧清子 · 古风 #3","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"我的马老了，走不快，我也不急，反正没有要去的地方。江湖很大，大到装得下所有相遇。江湖很小小到装不下两个人，所以我一个人刚刚好。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/0a/0a2c98f13bdd66ff299a0a24bb89c9d6a8bddd8b1b9306edb864920ea630a3b6.mp3"},{"voiceId":"4951b446-bbf8-423e-87f4-e9e41f42fad8","displayName":"猫耳FM - 祤毣君 · 古风","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"这世上的路有千万条，我偏偏选了最难走的那条等你的路。你问我值不值得，我说值得，不是因为我傻，是因为你值得我傻。这回答姑娘可满意。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/22/228c5c7aa3775293460af6f319b1a5acf94a0371c48c26529ca700d6b1a1bbb7.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ca69bc43-2ac5-42d3-b669-5533d2f11b5d","displayName":"猫耳FM - 祤毣君 · 古风 #2","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"世人为我风流，不过是看不惯这世间的痴情者，直到遇见你方知不是不爱，是未到深处。姑娘若肯回眸，我便收了这满身傲气，为你洗手做羹汤。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/62/623b696093d00f9b03e002b70671a225b5f7a1fa82f8bfc6c0e9c7dfecdd3611.mp3"},{"voiceId":"1906717f-41c4-4b12-90a7-0652ae698354","displayName":"猫耳FM - 祤毣君 · 古风 #3","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["古风"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"江湖上有人问我是谁，我说一个赶路的人问我去哪，我说前面问哪个前面，我说太阳落下去的方向，他听不懂，没关系，我自己知道就行。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/6c/6cf2c750d6314c7e338f6119a6fcbbb41d2235585cc52f5583d4b094c95183b0.mp3"},{"voiceId":"0d9ab57c-2482-4b37-81c1-6d7d8b983232","displayName":"猫耳听心 - 叶子 · 慵懒","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["慵懒"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"做了一个梦，梦到你走了，醒了以后给你发消息，你没回，我知道你在忙，但我就是慌。你看到消息的时候，能不能第一时间回我，哪怕只回一个在，我就安心了。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/fb/fb00fd966375a33c8d3c56e7de3ac56e144a78fc7726e21fce6210910d1a01bd.mp3"},{"voiceId":"561cf56c-b6b7-4bcc-8721-a93e53d4a1ed","displayName":"理科系中年男声 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"最近天气变化大，我跟你说啊，一定要注意身体，年轻时不当回事，现在才知道健康最重要。早上起来喝杯温水，晚上少熬夜，平时多运动，这都是我这些年总结出来的经验。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/64/646d3cb7d4e87a0eac58a1d848bdbe8260f23491ee4ccf35f0b8fb451f70d497.mp3"},{"voiceId":"2d76d076-bc0a-4e35-bb17-5a508cd5cb97","displayName":"男科医生 · 磁性","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["磁性"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"男性朋友们要注意，平时要保持良好的生活作息，不要熬夜喝酒、抽烟，建议每年做一次体检，有不适及时就医，预防剩余治疗，养成健康的生活方式才是关键。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/b2/b23f8083200111973a2573d505d78e022abbd923c2fa265ec389cbf5af56d460.mp3"},{"voiceId":"d4286c68-1999-44b2-adac-48b9f9b98b21","displayName":"病娇男声 · 磁性","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["磁性"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"原来最痛苦的不是失去，而是拥有过又弄丢的感觉，像手里还残留着你的温度。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/5c/5ce26a8acfbc86da3f5a4609dbbb641bffc1db2687fbcf4e586b033fba02efbd.mp3"},{"voiceId":"027af746-34f2-4c7b-a5ec-96f83b76f05e","displayName":"皮皮 · 明亮","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["明亮"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"大家好呀，今天给大家分享一个超有趣的小发现。我在家自制奶茶的时候，发现把珍珠放进去之前，先用蜂蜜腌一下，味道会特别赞哦。想不想试试看呀？评论区告诉我你们的想法吧。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/12/1249b672b5a12277aa596cf71b8422db203dec07a46bb5271fc0dc41283fada8.mp3"},{"voiceId":"4867b8b2-44a7-45b4-80d2-03a83788b5a3","displayName":"相声界奇人 · 磁性","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["磁性"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"您说这现在的年轻人一手机玩的可真溜，我那时候写字儿都得蘸墨汁儿，现在倒好，手指头往屏幕上一点就啥都有了，这不是显着我们老了吗？","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/68/683c01164c3d709ba18aed4a294954635e36ff9c1b5357866864a4d5b0bcfcee.mp3"},{"voiceId":"ea1bc6ec-cef1-47ee-9029-c3d92da01be3","displayName":"知性中年女教师 · 温柔","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"各位朋友们好，今天我想跟大家分享一个重要观点，专业发展需要持续学习。在这个快速变化的时代，只有不断更新知识储备，才能抓住新的机遇。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/93/937f3477ac550cd123939816657bf8fe8f8c84ee4d5e8e9b374e69ef3b6b333f.mp3"},{"voiceId":"bd103c8f-83a1-4278-b925-cab2fa39ca4b","displayName":"知性资深主持人 · 高冷","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["高冷"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"一部值得品味的佳作，人到中年，看这样的电影，更能体会其中的深意。角色们在命运的波澜中挣扎，抉择，如同我们自己的人生写照。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/cb/cbcfab9467ab7b2727fe3db0466f4e9c43a37443044ac4ad57da385b3f0d6029.mp3"},{"voiceId":"6bb83dba-23a8-4b5b-8078-eaa9f94b2fc8","displayName":"破碎感青年男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"笑着说，没事的那个晚上，枕头替我保存了所有眼泪，他比任何人都懂我的口是心非。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/44/446e9154a26829921e6b4872e465b5f0dd52337a0a4887688577421e13766ec5.mp3"},{"voiceId":"fd9df756-a2a4-42e7-ad59-b20094a271c4","displayName":"讲故事温柔男声 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"傍晚时分，我静静地坐在院子里，看着天空慢慢变成粉红色，远处的白云像棉花糖一样轻柔，微风轻轻吹过，带来了茉莉花的香气。这样平静的时刻，总让人感到温暖而安心。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/3f/3fbac5cbddd973cb6a2affd3d1a0de623432028c1cc67c1f0e0cdb7b7e77bcd3.mp3"},{"voiceId":"b8e52bf3-0e08-49f7-bc9a-b4f27749ad0e","displayName":"阳光奶狗男受音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"总在深夜想起那些没说出口的话，像窗外的月光，安静的碎了一地，再也捡不起来。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/68/68c3b53b205bc2f0632853ee0d06a4c198e7be955a83348e15a6f6f2fef301c3.mp3"},{"voiceId":"6b58ce73-98cf-4a85-b1df-70be290fd8ed","displayName":"隐忍内敛青年男音 · 沉稳","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"或许是我想太多，总觉得月亮也在偷看我的孤单，不然为什么每晚都陪我到深夜？","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/f0/f066a129de9a835a8191dbb6139465872961e0ba5657e5ea5187886900c2f02b.mp3"},{"voiceId":"7f915604-8500-4609-b7b6-e1132bec6c68","displayName":"魅力主持一姐 · 御姐感","locale":"有声书","category":"有声书","matchedScenes":["有声书"],"styleLabels":["御姐感"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"读书不仅仅是获取知识，更是滋养心灵的过程。当我们翻开书页的那一刻，就像打开了一扇通向智慧的窗户。生活中的每一次阅读，都是与先贤对话的珍贵时刻。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/1e/1e31f5409a9465de858ff8bf5bdbc6da2f9ea768f7fda8224bfa7c3a252ea12f.mp3"}]
